invariant: INV-62
file: mldsa_sign_steps.c
catches: test/wycheproof.sh
reason: a round passes with a low-bits coefficient of w - c s2 at exactly
  gamma2 - beta, which FIPS 204 Algorithm 7 rejects, since it requires
  the infinity norm below that bound. The signer then returns the
  signature of an earlier round than FIPS 204's, and Wycheproof's
  boundary cases sign at that edge.

--- old
        reject |= mlds_at_least(r0, MLD_GAMMA2 - MLD_BETA);
--- new
        reject |= mlds_at_least(r0, MLD_GAMMA2 - MLD_BETA + 1);
